    chore(board): file GAP-005 — orphaned LoopController still has the no-exit defect
    
    GAP-004 (landed 90d92ec5, sibling-landed merge 689446b6) fixed the exit paths in
    specs/implementation.spec.dir/src/ralph-loop.ts. The same defect class survives in a
    second, unreachable copy: src/ralph-loop/controller.ts defines a LoopController with
    no signal handler, no launcher-liveness check and no idle bound. Nothing imports
    src/ralph-loop/index.ts today, so it cannot leak yet — filed P3 so a future import does
    not silently reintroduce the 1.6 GB orphan class.
    
    Co-authored-by: Alexis Okuwa <wojonstech@gmail.com>
